{"type":"tool_result","callId":"chatcmpl-tool-9db0e475341d17e4","status":"completed","result":"  phase_synthesis:\n    purpose: Compile all iteration findings into final research/research.md\n    steps:\n\n      step_fanout_merge:\n        description: \"Merge N lineage registries into one consolidated registry; skip when single-executor\"\n        skip_when: \"config.fanout is absent\"\n        command: |\n          node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-merge.cjs \\\n            --loop-type research \\\n            --artifact-dir {artifact_dir}\n        working_directory: \"{repo_root}\"\n        wait_for_completion: true\n\n      step_hydrate_summary_metrics:\n        action: \"Hydrate summary metrics before synthesis\"\n        read:\n          - \"{state_paths.config}\"\n          - \"{state_paths.state_log}\"\n          - \"{state_paths.registry}\"\n          - \"{state_paths.strategy}\"\n        read_patterns:\n          - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/*/deep-research-state.jsonl\"\n          - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/*/deep-research-strategy.md\"\n        extract:\n          - iteration_count: \"When direct lineage state logs exist, count distinct run values (run, else iteration) across those logs in stable lineage order; otherwise count distinct run values (run, else iteration) across the root state log. Never add root compatibility records to lineage records.\"\n          - highest_run: \"When direct lineage state logs exist, take the highest run value (run, else iteration) across lines where type === 'iteration' in those logs in stable lineage order, else 0; otherwise take the highest run value (run, else iteration) across lines where type === 'iteration' in the root state log, else 0. Never add root compatibility records to lineage records.\"\n          - current_iteration: \"max(highest_run, iteration_count) + 1\"\n          - current_segment: \"Latest segment_start event segment, else 1\"\n          - last_focus: \"Extract focus from latest iteration record, else 'none yet'\"\n          - ratio_prev: \"Extract newInfoRatio from second-latest iteration record, else 'N/A'\"\n          - ratio_latest: \"Extract newInfoRatio from latest iteration record, else 'N/A'\"\n          - remaining_questions: \"Count unchecked items in 'Key Questions'\"\n          - remaining_questions_list: \"List unchecked key questions from strategy.md\"\n          - answered_count: \"Count answered questions from strategy.md\"\n          - total_questions: \"Count total questions tracked in strategy.md\"\n          - last_3_summaries: \"Summarize the latest 3 iteration records as 'run N: focus (ratio)'\"\n          - divergence_summary: \"Read registry.divergence and summarize saturated directions, completed pivots, failures, overrides, Council artifact refs, and remaining frontier; else 'no divergent pivots recorded'\"\n          - reason: \"Use the latest synthesis/recovery stop reason if present, else the frozen default 'converged'. (Must be a member of the STOP_REASONS enum: converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused.)\"\n\n      step_read_all_iterations:\n        action: \"Read all iteration files and strategy\"\n        read_patterns:\n          - \"{state_paths.iteration_dir}/iteration-*.md\"\n          - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/*/iterations/iteration-*.md\"\n        read_also: \"{state_paths.strategy}\"\n        identity: \"Preserve each full source path and lineage label. Duplicate basenames from different lineages are distinct synthesis inputs; do not copy or renumber them.\"\n        selection: \"When lineage iteration files exist, synthesize from those files in stable lineage-plus-iteration order; otherwise use root iterations.\"\n\n      step_emit_resource_map:\n        action: \"Emit {state_paths.resource_map_output} from converged research deltas unless config.resource_map.emit is false\"\n        branch_on: \"config.fanout\"\n        if_present:\n          command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} --emit-resource-map --fanout-resource-map-only\"\n          read:\n            - \"{state_paths.config}\"\n            - \"{state_paths.delta_dir}/iter-*.jsonl\"\n            - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/*/deltas/iter-*.jsonl\"\n        if_absent:\n          command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} --emit-resource-map\"\n          read:\n            - \"{state_paths.config}\"\n            - \"{state_paths.delta_dir}/iter-*.jsonl\"\n        write:\n          - \"{state_paths.resource_map_output}\"\n        guarantee: \"Fan-out resource-map emission reads lineage deltas in place and writes only resource-map.md; it never rewrites merged registries, strategy, or dashboard. Single-executor reduction remains unchanged.\"\n\n      step_compile_research:\n        action: \"Compile or finalize research/research.md\"\n        instructions: |\n          If research/research.md exists (progressive synthesis was active):\n            1. Read current research/research.md\n            2. Consolidate and deduplicate findings across all iterations\n            3. Fill any empty sections with findings from iteration files\n            4. Remove redundancy while preserving all unique findings\n            5. Add convergence report as appendix\n            6. If `resource_map_present` is true, cite `{spec_folder}/resource-map.md` in References; otherwise omit any placeholder map citation\n            7. Preserve the mandatory `## Eliminated Alternatives` section, then add or replace `## Divergence Map` immediately after it and before Section 12 Open Questions. Populate it from `{state_paths.registry}` with saturated directions, pivots taken, evidence and Council artifact references, pivot failures and audited overrides, and the remaining frontier.\n\n          If research/research.md does not exist:\n            1. Create research/research.md following 17-section template\n            2. Populate sections from iteration files\n            3. Add citations from original sources\n            4. Note unanswered questions in Open Questions section\n            5. If `resource_map_present` is true, cite `{spec_folder}/resource-map.md` in References; otherwise omit any placeholder map citation\n            6. After the mandatory `## Eliminated Alternatives` section and before Section 12 Open Questions, add `## Divergence Map` with saturated directions, pivots taken, evidence and Council artifact references, pivot failures and audited overrides, and the remaining frontier from `{state_paths.registry}`.\n          Divergence Map documents breadth. Never claim the topic converged merely because divergent mode broadened the investigated frontier.\n          Preserve machine-owned markers so the reducer-owned registry, dashboard, and strategy anchors can be refreshed on re-run without mutating prior synthesis. (Note: `completed-continue` lineage branch is deferred — see `deep-research/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md §Lifecycle Branch Contract`.)\n        output: \"{state_paths.research_output}\"\n\n      step_convergence_report:\n        action: \"Generate and append convergence report\"\n        report: |\n          ## Convergence Report\n          - Stop reason: {reason}\n          - Total iterations: {iteration_count}\n          - Questions answered: {answered_count} / {total_questions}\n          - Remaining questions: {remaining_questions}\n          - Last 3 iteration summaries: {last_3_summaries}\n          - Convergence threshold: {convergence_threshold}\n          - Divergence summary: {divergence_summary}\n          - Segment transitions, wave scores, and checkpoint metrics are experimental and omitted from the live report.\n        command: |\n          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n          EVENT_DIR=\"$(mktemp -d \"${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/deep-research-synthesis.XXXXXX\")\"\n          CLOSEOUT=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs\"\n          [ -f \"$CLOSEOUT\" ] || CLOSEOUT=\"scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs\"\n          node \"$CLOSEOUT\" --mode research --event-dir \"$EVENT_DIR\" \\\n            --artifact-dir \"{state_paths.packet_dir}\" \\\n            --state-log \"{state_path","truncated":true}
