{"type":"thinking","text":"Excellent. Research question answered precisely:\n- Two route patches:\n  - llmgateway: baseURL https://api.llmgateway.io/v1, model deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017, reasoningEffort max (reasoning efforts off/high/max).\n  - opencode-go: baseURL https://opencode.ai/zen/go/v1, model deepseek-v4.1-flash, reasoningEffort max, endpoint unverified.\n- Other patches (guards, lineage, mcp-code-mode) are not route patches and declare no endpoint/model/reasoning effort.\n\nNow, need to check for steer.md and then proceed with init. Also check whether the reducer requires certain config fields. The config template has \"antiConvergence.minIterations\" and \"stopPolicy\": \"fail-closed\" but populate step sets antiConvergence.convergenceMode and stuckThreshold etc. The YAML populate says:\n- topic\n- maxIterations: 1\n- minIterations: 3 (top-level?)\n- convergenceThreshold: 0.05? Dispatch says config.stopPolicy: convergence. Convergence threshold default 0.05.\n- stopPolicy: convergence\n- antiConvergence.convergenceMode: default\n- antiConvergence.divergent: {}\n- stuckThreshold 3\n- minIdeaObservations 2\n- maxDurationMinutes 120\n- specFolder\n- resource_map_present: false\n- resource_map.emit: true\n- createdAt\n- status initialized\n- executionMode auto\n- lineage.sessionId: fanout-dsh-rc3-1794662312097-eo5r8r\n- lineage.parentSessionId null\n- lineage.lineageMode new\n- lineage.generation 1\n- lineage.continuedFromRun null\n- nextRunAt null\n- remainingDelayMs null\n\nWait, the template config has antiConvergence.minIterations and stopPolicy \"fail-closed\" but YAML says populate minIterations: 3 and stopPolicy. So it overrides. Effective min iterations = 3, but maxIterations=1. The step_read_state clamps effective_min_iterations to max_iterations = 1. Since iteration_count=0 before iteration 1, maxIterations check: iteration_count >= max_iterations → 0 >= 1 false. Continue. After iteration, check convergence: iteration_count >= 1 → STOP maxIterationsReached. So one iteration.\n\nAlso note the dispatch says `config.maxIterations: 1` and stopPolicy convergence. Good.\n\nBefore init, read steer.md when exists — doesn't exist. I'll check again.\n\nAlso `executor` block should probably be set based on invocation metadata (cli-deepseek-harness model deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017). The workflow owns executor provenance; for fan-out, the config should reflect effectiveConfig. The fanout-run sets this perhaps. Let me check the existing sibling lineages or an example of a completed lineage to model the config. Let me look at fanout-live dir: it has orchestrator files. Is there a base artifact dir with config? Let me check siblings? The lineages dir only has dsh-rc3. Maybe other lineage dirs exist in parallel elsewhere? Let me inspect `fanout-live/lineages` and any base artifacts.\n\nAlso need to check `append-mode-event.cjs` behavior. Let me inspect the gateway script quickly for required fields and how \"run\" is derived. And reduce-state usage. Let me check `--help` by reading the script heads."}
